thereby whereby hitherto hence thence whence divers tis fro th em ve ll re un de ma eh hee
doe mr mrs st ain shalt wilt dost canst unto amongst aught naught behold beheld oft le
alas anon perchance methinks betwixt twixt prithee mayst hast hadst wouldst couldst
mamma papa
hell bloody damn damned
